                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME DE PRODUCTION D'AÉROSOL ÉQUIPÉ DE QUATRE CONTACTS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">AEROSOL-GENERATING SYSTEM WITH CHARGING DEVICE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An electrically operable aerosol-generating system comprises a charging device comprising a primary power source, and an elongated aerosol-generating device comprising a secondary power source. The charging device has a docking arrangement configured to engage with the aerosol-generating device, the docking arrangement comprising a docking space defined between a first end, and an opposing second end spaced from and fixed relative to the first end. The docking space accommodates a longitudinal dimension of the elongated aerosol-generating device between the first end and the second end. The aerosol-generating device can be engaged with the docking arrangement by means of a transverse movement.</p>
            </abstract>
